+A shortcode embedding programmatic animations built with Canvas Commons (called Motion Canvas
+before the rename). The extension, from <https://github.com/andrie/quarto-canvas-commons>
+(`quarto add andrie/quarto-canvas-commons`), ships the player and loads it itself, so a deck needs
